0.196 0.196 0.235 rg
39.6850393700787407 649.1340944881889072 Td
(When deploying MikroTik routers on client sites, cellular networks \(MTN, Airtel, Glo\), Starlink, or local fiber ISPs use Carrier-Grade) Tj
T* (NAT \(CGNAT\). The router gets a private WAN IP \(e.g. 100.64.x.x or 10.x.x.x\). Cloud servers \(like Vercel\) CANNOT initiate) Tj
T* (incoming connections to private IPs. Furthermore, MikroTik IP Cloud DDNS fails behind CGNAT because the public IP is shared) Tj
T* (and inbound ports are blocked by the ISP.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
