13.7999999999999989 TL
0.071 0.071 0.09 rg
39.6850393700787407 570.8978740157480161 Td
(A single Hostinger Ubuntu VPS with a static public IP acts as a secure WireGuard VPN and) Tj
T* (port-forwarding hub. Each MikroTik router dials OUT to the VPS on UDP port 51820.) Tj
T* (Because the connection is outbound, CGNAT and ISP firewalls never block it. The VPS) Tj
T* (assigns a private tunnel IP \(10.100.0.X\) to each router and forwards a unique external port) Tj
T* (\(8443, 8444, 8445...\) to that router's REST API \(port 443\).) Tj
ET
